{
  "lessonId": "L1M4L1",
  "title": "義式料理與葡萄酒入門",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60 0%,#2ecc71 100%)'><h1>🍝 義式料理與葡萄酒入門</h1><p class='subtitle'>從餐桌文化到完美配對</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🇮🇹 義大利餐酒文化</h2><div class='culture-intro'><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-icon'>🍷</div><h3>葡萄酒是餐桌必需品</h3><p>義大利人視葡萄酒為「液體麵包」，每餐必備。不是為了喝醉，而是為了提升用餐體驗。</p></div><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-icon'>🌍</div><h3>地域性至上</h3><p>「當地菜配當地酒」是金科玉律。千年飲食文化已找到最佳組合。</p></div><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-icon'>⚖️</div><h3>平衡與和諧</h3><p>配餐重點不在「壓過」而在「提升」。酒與食物應相互襯托，而非競爭。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📚 配餐基本原則</h2><div class='principles-grid'><div class='principle-card weight'><div class='principle-num'>1</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>⚖️ 重量匹配</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p><strong>輕盈料理</strong> ↔ <strong>輕盈酒體</strong></p><p><strong>濃郁料理</strong> ↔ <strong>飽滿酒體</strong></p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 清蒸魚 + Pinot Grigio</p><p>✓ 燉牛肉 + Barolo</p><p>✗ 沙拉 + Amarone（太強）</p></div></div></div><div class='principle-card acidity'><div class='principle-num'>2</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>🍋 酸度平衡</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p><strong>酸性料理</strong>（番茄、醋）需要<strong>高酸度酒</strong></p><p>酒的酸度應≥食物酸度</p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 番茄義大利麵 + Chianti（高酸）</p><p>✓ 檸檬海鮮 + Verdicchio</p><p>✗ 番茄菜 + 低酸酒（會顯苦）</p></div></div></div><div class='principle-card fat'><div class='principle-num'>3</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>🧈 油脂切割</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p><strong>高油脂料理</strong>需要<strong>高酸度或高單寧</strong>來切割</p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 炸海鮮 + 氣泡酒（酸度清爽）</p><p>✓ 牛排 + Sangiovese（單寧）</p><p>✓ 起司 + 紅酒（單寧化解油膩）</p></div></div></div><div class='principle-card flavor'><div class='principle-num'>4</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>🌿 風味呼應</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p>找出酒與食物的<strong>共同風味元素</strong></p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 蘑菇燉飯 + Nebbiolo（土壤香）</p><p>✓ 香草雞肉 + Vermentino（香草味）</p><p>✓ 黑櫻桃醬 + Barbera（櫻桃味）</p></div></div></div><div class='principle-card sweetness'><div class='principle-num'>5</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>🍯 甜度法則</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p><strong>酒的甜度必須 ≥ 食物甜度</strong></p><p>否則酒會顯得酸澀</p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 提拉米蘇 + Moscato d'Asti</p><p>✓ Panna Cotta + Recioto</p><p>✗ 甜點 + 不甜酒（大忌）</p></div></div></div><div class='principle-card contrast'><div class='principle-num'>6</div><div class='principle-content'><h4>⚡ 對比原則</h4><div class='principle-desc'><p>有時<strong>對比</strong>比相似更出色</p></div><div class='example'><p>✓ 鹹起司 + 甜酒（Gorgonzola + 甜白）</p><p>✓ 辣食 + 微甜氣泡酒</p><p>✓ 油炸 + 清爽氣泡</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍝 義大利麵配酒指南</h2><div class='pasta-pairing'><div class='pasta-row'><div class='pasta-dish'><h4>🍅 紅醬系列</h4><p>番茄醬、肉醬、Arrabbiata</p></div><div class='pasta-arrow'>→</div><div class='pasta-wine'><p><strong>高酸度紅酒</strong></p><ul><li>Chianti Classico</li><li>Barbera d'Alba</li><li>Sangiovese</li></ul></div></div><div class='pasta-row'><div class='pasta-dish'><h4>🧈 白醬系列</h4><p>奶油白醬、Carbonara、Alfredo</p></div><div class='pasta-arrow'>→</div><div class='pasta-wine'><p><strong>中等酒體白酒</strong></p><ul><li>Pinot Grigio</li><li>Soave Classico</li><li>Verdicchio</li></ul></div></div><div class='pasta-row'><div class='pasta-dish'><h4>🌿 青醬系列</h4><p>Pesto, 橄欖油蒜香</p></div><div class='pasta-arrow'>→</div><div class='pasta-wine'><p><strong>香草味白酒</strong></p><ul><li>Vermentino</li><li>Gavi (Cortese)</li><li>Vernaccia di San Gimignano</li></ul></div></div><div class='pasta-row'><div class='pasta-dish'><h4>🦐 海鮮系列</h4><p>蛤蜊麵、墨魚麵、龍蝦麵</p></div><div class='pasta-arrow'>→</div><div class='pasta-wine'><p><strong>清新白酒或氣泡酒</strong></p><ul><li>Verdicchio</li><li>Soave</li><li>Franciacorta</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍕 Pizza 配酒</h2><div class='pizza-section'><div class='pizza-intro'><h3>🍕 Pizza 的配酒挑戰</h3><p>Pizza 有多種配料、高溫烘烤、番茄醬底，需要<strong>高酸度、中等酒體、果香豐富</strong>的酒款。</p></div><div class='pizza-wines'><div class='pizza-wine-card best'><div class='card-badge'>最佳選擇</div><h4>🔴 Chianti</h4><p>高酸度完美匹配番茄醬，櫻桃味與 Mozzarella 和諧。</p></div><div class='pizza-wine-card good'><div class='card-badge'>優質選擇</div><h4>🔴 Barbera</h4><p>低單寧高酸，不會與起司衝突，果香豐富。</p></div><div class='pizza-wine-card fresh'><div class='card-badge'>清爽選擇</div><h4>🥂 Prosecco</h4><p>氣泡切割油膩，清爽解膩，適合輕盈口味。</p></div><div class='pizza-wine-card casual'><div class='card-badge'>日常選擇</div><h4>🔴 Montepulciano d'Abruzzo</h4><p>性價比高，果香濃郁，酸度適中，百搭。</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🧀 起司配酒</h2><div class='cheese-pairing-grid'><div class='cheese-item'><h4>🧀 新鮮起司</h4><p class='cheese-type'>Mozzarella, Ricotta, Burrata</p><div class='wine-rec'>🍾 <strong>推薦：</strong>Prosecco, Pinot Grigio<br>清爽白酒或氣泡酒不壓過細膩風味</div></div><div class='cheese-item'><h4>🧀 半硬質起司</h4><p class='cheese-type'>Pecorino Romano, Parmigiano-Reggiano</p><div class='wine-rec'>🍷 <strong>推薦：</strong>Sangiovese, Chianti<br>酸度與鹹度平衡，單寧化解油脂</div></div><div class='cheese-item'><h4>🧀 藍紋起司</h4><p class='cheese-type'>Gorgonzola</p><div class='wine-rec'>🍯 <strong>推薦：</strong>Moscato d'Asti, Recioto della Valpolicella<br>甜酒與鹹味形成絕妙對比</div></div><div class='cheese-item'><h4>🧀 陳年硬質起司</h4><p class='cheese-type'>陳年 Parmigiano (24-36 月)</p><div class='wine-rec'>🍷 <strong>推薦：</strong>Amarone, Barolo<br>濃郁酒體匹配強烈風味</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ 義大利配餐強調「地域性」- 當地菜配當地酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 重量匹配：輕料理配輕酒，重料理配重酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 酸度平衡：番茄料理必須配高酸度酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 油脂切割：高油脂需要高酸度或高單寧</div><div class='point'>✓ 甜度法則：酒的甜度必須 ≥ 食物甜度</div><div class='point'>✓ Pizza 和義大利麵最佳搭配是高酸度紅酒</div></div></section></div><style>.culture-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin:25px 0}.culture-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.culture-icon{font-size:3.5rem;margin-bottom:15px}.culture-card h3{margin:15px 0;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.2rem}.culture-card p{color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.principles-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.principle-card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.principle-num{width:50px;height:50px;background:#27ae60;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 auto 15px}.principle-content h4{margin:0 0 12px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.2rem;text-align:center}.principle-desc{background:#f8f9fa;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px}.principle-desc p{margin:8px 0;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600}.example{border-top:2px solid #ecf0f1;padding-top:12px;margin-top:12px}.example p{margin:6px 0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6}.pasta-pairing{display:grid;gap:15px}.pasta-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr auto 2fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pasta-dish{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #27ae60}.pasta-dish h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.2rem}.pasta-dish p{margin:0;color:#555}.pasta-arrow{font-size:2rem;color:#27ae60;font-weight:700}.pasta-wine{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085}.pasta-wine p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;color:#16a085}.pasta-wine ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.pizza-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pizza-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:3px solid #ecf0f1}.pizza-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.5rem}.pizza-intro p{margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.1rem}.pizza-wines{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.pizza-wine-card{padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid;position:relative}.pizza-wine-card.best{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e6,#fff);border-color:#f39c12}.pizza-wine-card.good{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e8f8f5,#fff);border-color:#16a085}.pizza-wine-card.fresh{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ebf5fb,#fff);border-color:#3498db}.pizza-wine-card.casual{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f4ecf7,#fff);border-color:#9b59b6}.card-badge{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:5px 15px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.pizza-wine-card h4{margin:15px 0 10px;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.2rem}.pizza-wine-card p{margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.6}.cheese-pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.cheese-item{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #27ae60;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cheese-item h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.2rem}.cheese-type{margin:0 0 15px;color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic}.wine-rec{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,transparent);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #16a085;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8f8f5,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #27ae60;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
